{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】高空反氣旋正為華南帶來普遍晴朗的天氣。本港今日(10月13日)天氣預測，天晴。日間乾燥及炎熱，市區最高氣溫約32度，新界再高一兩度。吹微風。</p>\n<p>展望明日大致天晴及炎熱，稍後轉吹清勁東風及有一兩陣微雨。隨後兩三日部分時間有陽光。</p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T23:39:12.098054+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T23:17:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T23:37:40.525404+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T23:37:40.525404+00:00","content_hash":"e73dadb7a85741ef749fcd8aa2b967a0062ebd9538780cc440bf3bfeee5ae785","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}